through. Z","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T16:06:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039995","verified_at":"2026-10-24T19:33:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1847286114032216","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"announcement","title":"October 22: Progression & Casino Balance","summary":"This balance update focuses on easing progression and reducing the pressure to keep upgrading, alongside changes to the casino and artifacts. Progression & debt Reduced base chapter debt to 15,000 / 30,000 / 50,000 gold for Chapters 1 / 2 / 3. In co-op, party-size multipliers apply to these amounts. Reduced total party debt multipliers to 190% / 270% / 340% for 2 / 3 / 4 players, reducing the per-player burden in larger parties. Reduced weapon upgrade costs. Each upgrade from Retro Raygun MK1 th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:11:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032216","verified_at":"2026-10-22T13:08:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1847286114032215","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"announcement","title":"Quality of Life, Balance & Harbor Visuals","summary":"Hello, Hunters. Thank you for playing Gamble Hunters and sharing your feedback. This patch includes quality-of-life improvements, gameplay balance adjustments, and updates to the Harbor. Quality of life Added an option to skip the cutscene that plays after a boss is defeated. Improved UI font handling for localized text, fixing an issue where longer text could extend beyond its UI area. Reduced the time limit for the duck-picking minigame from 60 seconds to 30 seconds. Gameplay balance Reduced t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:10:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032215","verified_at":"2026-10-22T13:08:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1846651706696165","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"announcement","title":"Language, UI & Combat Balance","summary":"Hello, Hunters. Thank you for playing Gamble Hunters and sharing your feedback. Here are the changes in this update. Language settings and UI When no language preference has been saved, the game now selects a supported language based on your operating system. Your manually saved choice takes priority. If your OS language is unsupported or cannot be detected, the game uses its default language. Language selection in Settings now uses a dropdown menu. Redesigned the dashboard's casino information ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:33:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696165","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1846651706694436","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"announcement","title":"Keep Your Rupees After Defeat","summary":"Hello, Hunters. This patch includes the following change: When you lose a battle, your Rupees no longer reset to 0. You now keep the Rupees you have earned up to that point. Thank you for playing Gamble Hunters. The Gamble Hunters Team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:28:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694436","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1846651706694048","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"announcement","title":"Stage Difficulty and Balance","summary":"Hello, Hunters! We’re aware that stage difficulty in the current demo still needs balancing. What feels too easy for some players can feel too difficult for others, and finding a balance that works well for everyone has been more challenging than we expected. We’re collecting and carefully reviewing your feedback, and we will continue adjusting stage balance as development progresses. Keeping Your Rupees After a Defeat We are aware that Rupees earned during a combat stage are currently not retai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T07:25:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694048","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1846651706692957","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"update","title":"DEMO UPDATE: New Chapters, Second Chances, and More","summary":"Hello Hunters, The GAMBLE HUNTERS DEMO is growing! This update expands the adventure with new chapters and enemies, new ways to face your debt, and changes to progression, recovery, and combat. More Chapters, More Trouble Added five stages to Chapter 2 and five stages to Chapter 3, including flying-fish encounters and a sardine migration. Reworked Chapter 1 stages and BubbleCrab's boss patterns, and updated underwater, winter, sky, cloud, and lighting visuals across the chapters. Meet Octonapper","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:38:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692957","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1846651706692458","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"announcement","title":"Departure Bug, Balance & Visual Issues","summary":"Hello, Hunters! Urgent: Departure blocked if Casino Time expires during blackjack We’ve identified a bug that prevents you from using Departure if Casino Time expires while you’re playing blackjack. We’re urgently working to fix this and are aiming to resolve it within the next few hours. Balance issues affecting difficulty We have also identified balance errors affecting the game’s difficulty and are urgently working to fix them. The intended changes to in-game currency costs for gambling have ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:34:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692458","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1846651706691984","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"update","title":"Update Plans: A Look at What’s Next for Gamble Hunters","summary":"Hello, Hunters! Thank you for all the feedback you’ve shared with us. We’d like to give you an early look at the updates we’re preparing based on your suggestions. We’re working to bring the upcoming improvements to you as soon as possible. Alongside those updates, we’re also sharing a few ideas that are still under consideration. Hold to play Plinko We know it can be a chore to spend your leftover change in Plinko. We’re adding a press-and-hold option to the Plinko button so it automatically re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:57:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691984","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1846651706691770","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"announcement","title":"Monsters Not Visible in Multiplayer","summary":"Hello, Hunters! We’re aware of an issue where monsters are not visible to a small number of players during combat stages in multiplayer. This issue has not been resolved yet, and we are actively working on a fix. We’re doing our best to resolve it as quickly as possible so you can enjoy a smooth gameplay experience. We’re sorry for the inconvenience, and thank you for your patience and understanding. The Gamble Hunters Team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:25:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691770","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1846018067941157","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"update","title":"DEMO Update: Co-op Fixes, UI Polish, and Clearer Feedback","summary":"Hello Hunters, Thank you for playing the GAMBLE HUNTERS DEMO. This update focuses on co-op fixes, UI polish, and clearer feedback in combat and at the casino. Co-op and Stability Improved hit detection for guests so shots line up more closely with what they see on screen. Fixed guests being disconnected when the host departed immediately after the party spent its last Rupees on Plinko. Fixed disconnects caused by guest actions just before departure, and added safeguards against disconnects cause","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:36:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941157","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1846018067931115","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"update","title":"DEMO Update: Credits, Character Visuals, and Combat Polish","summary":"Hello Hunters,Thank you for playing the GAMBLE HUNTERS DEMO. This update adds a credits screen and fine-tunes character visuals and combat feedback.🎨 Visuals and AppearanceAdded a credits screen.Adjusted the appearance of the art costumes.Improved hat visibility on screen.🔫 CombatRemoved the weapon trail that was getting in the way when aiming.Increased bullet speed so shots feel closer to the game's hitscan behavior.Let us know what you think in the Discussions, and keep the bug reports coming.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T18:56:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931115","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1846018067925138","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"update","title":"Demo Balance Patch: October 6, 2026","summary":"Hello Hunters, Thank you for playing the GAMBLE HUNTERS demo. We've been reading your feedback and watching how runs play out, and a few parts of the economy were clearly off. Today's update brings them back in line and fixes a few issues along the way. 🎰 Slot MachineJackpots and 777 Jackpots now hit more often, but each one pays out much less.Regular wins are unchanged.The Mega Win celebration now plays on smaller wins than before. 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Multiplayer (2 to 4 Players)In co-op, Rupees piled up f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T06:28:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925138","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117630-1845383656396253","game_id":"steam-5117630","kind":"announcement","title":"The GAMBLE HUNTERS Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"Hello, everyone!The GAMBLE HUNTERS demo is now available on Steam!Thank you for waiting while we fixed the multiplayer connection issue.The demo is ready, and you can download it for free from our store page right now. What's in the demoCasino and roulette gameplay where your luck can change everythingExploration and combatOnline co-op, so you can play with your friends We need your feedbackThis is our first demo, and the game is still in development. Not everything is finished yet, but your tho","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T12:20:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396253","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5117630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5117630":"2026-10-26T08:23:59Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5117630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:59Z"},"5253310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:59Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5117630","app_id":5117630,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:32Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"74b639b8724c7436efb7a9435ba7d67f2896655f0d2a9c2b646a164bfa74297a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"겜블 헌터스는 혼자 또는 최대 4명이 즐기는 1인칭 카지노 액션 로그라이트입니다. 지갑은 하나, 헌터는 넷, 신뢰는 제로! 60초 동안 몰려오는 몬스터를 쏴 공용 루피를 모으고, 친구들보다 먼저 슬롯머신과 룰렛, 블랙잭 등 다양한 겜블에 걸어 내 골드로 바꾸세요. 루피는 모두의 것, 골드는 내 것, 빚은 우리 것입니다. 획득한 골드로 무기를 강화하고, 특성 및 아티팩트를 조합해 나만의 빌드를 완성하세요. 더 강한 보스에 도전하세요. 빚을 갚지 못하면 파산입니다.","publishers":[{"name":"ASHUR Inc.","creator_clan_account_id":46275546}],"developers":[{"name":"ASHUR Inc.","creator_clan_account_id":46